OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fincreasing overnight, with showery
OL,7,Frain arriving from the west, this
OL,8,Fpotentially heavy at times. A rather
OL,9,Fmild night under the blanket of cloud.
OL,10,FLight winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA cloudy day ahead with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain likely, becoming
OL,14,Fmore persistent and heavy later in the
OL,15,Fday. Moderate to fresh southwesterly
OL,16,Fwinds.
